    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Dark Dungeon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dungeon where deadly creatures and ancient evil lurk in the shadows. Only your quick reflexes, sharp strategy, and survival instincts will keep you alive as you battle wave after wave of relentless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold, upgrade your weapons and skills, and face off against demonic foes who want to steal your soul. But beware\u2014each wave grows stronger, and danger hides around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/81eb1650de9e39fe83c3ecac988f0bf5.poster.avif?t=1754215945\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/81eb1650de9e39fe83c3ecac988f0bf5.webm?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/81eb1650de9e39fe83c3ecac988f0bf5.mp4?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stunning Pixel Art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious atmosphere of the dungeon with beautifully crafted pixel art. Every battle is enhanced by fluid animations and striking visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/fcc18a53ba65db75948323f3a4496e1c.poster.avif?t=1754215945\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/fcc18a53ba65db75948323f3a4496e1c.webm?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump straight into the fight! With quick and intense gameplay, you'll dive deep into the dungeon and confront swarms of enemies in thrilling combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/4daafc2d99206cbc1080477397578b90.poster.avif?t=1754215945\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/4daafc2d99206cbc1080477397578b90.webm?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/4daafc2d99206cbc1080477397578b90.mp4?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fluid and Dynamic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, strike, and outmaneuver your enemies. Upgrade your weapons and skills to change the tide of battle with carefully designed mechanics that make every hit feel impactful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rogue-Lite Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave becomes harder, more complex, and deadlier. Gather gold, grow stronger, and push further with every attempt. Death is inevitable\u2014but every run teaches you something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/13786f0f44ccb97233d8ba4bd4e361a7.poster.avif?t=1754215945\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/13786f0f44ccb97233d8ba4bd4e361a7.webm?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/13786f0f44ccb97233d8ba4bd4e361a7.mp4?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful abilities that shift your combat style. Customize your strategy and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/173b449a0bfeea2d8428070bc676b7b1.poster.avif?t=1754215945\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/173b449a0bfeea2d8428070bc676b7b1.webm?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/173b449a0bfeea2d8428070bc676b7b1.mp4?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-based rogue-lite action:</strong> every run is unique, every wave more challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense and strategic battles:</strong> smart moves are key to survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful abilities:</strong> shape your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art graphics:</strong> an atmospheric visual journey in the dark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>soul of the dungeon</strong> calls to you. Get stronger, survive, and become its greatest warrior.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Dark Dungeon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a dungeon where deadly creatures and ancient evil lurk in the shadows. Only your quick reflexes, sharp strategy, and survival instincts will keep you alive as you battle wave after wave of relentless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold, upgrade your weapons and skills, and face off against demonic foes who want to steal your soul. But beware\u2014each wave grows stronger, and danger hides around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/81eb1650de9e39fe83c3ecac988f0bf5.poster.avif?t=1754215945\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/81eb1650de9e39fe83c3ecac988f0bf5.webm?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/81eb1650de9e39fe83c3ecac988f0bf5.mp4?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stunning Pixel Art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious atmosphere of the dungeon with beautifully crafted pixel art. Every battle is enhanced by fluid animations and striking visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/fcc18a53ba65db75948323f3a4496e1c.poster.avif?t=1754215945\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/fcc18a53ba65db75948323f3a4496e1c.webm?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump straight into the fight! With quick and intense gameplay, you'll dive deep into the dungeon and confront swarms of enemies in thrilling combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/4daafc2d99206cbc1080477397578b90.poster.avif?t=1754215945\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/4daafc2d99206cbc1080477397578b90.webm?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/4daafc2d99206cbc1080477397578b90.mp4?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fluid and Dynamic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, strike, and outmaneuver your enemies. Upgrade your weapons and skills to change the tide of battle with carefully designed mechanics that make every hit feel impactful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rogue-Lite Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave becomes harder, more complex, and deadlier. Gather gold, grow stronger, and push further with every attempt. Death is inevitable\u2014but every run teaches you something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/13786f0f44ccb97233d8ba4bd4e361a7.poster.avif?t=1754215945\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/13786f0f44ccb97233d8ba4bd4e361a7.webm?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/13786f0f44ccb97233d8ba4bd4e361a7.mp4?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful abilities that shift your combat style. Customize your strategy and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/173b449a0bfeea2d8428070bc676b7b1.poster.avif?t=1754215945\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/173b449a0bfeea2d8428070bc676b7b1.webm?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582230/extras/173b449a0bfeea2d8428070bc676b7b1.mp4?t=1754215945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-based rogue-lite action:</strong> every run is unique, every wave more challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense and strategic battles:</strong> smart moves are key to survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful abilities:</strong> shape your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art graphics:</strong> an atmospheric visual journey in the dark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>soul of the dungeon</strong> calls to you. Get stronger, survive, and become its greatest warrior.</p>",
    "short_description": "A wave-based rogue-lite action game! Enter the dark dungeon, fight hordes of enemies, collect gold, upgrade your skills, and survive. Every wave is harder, every battle makes you stronger.",
